    {
      "name": "Blinding Breath",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "concentrate",
        "divine",
        "void"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The gholdako exhales a 60ft Cone of noxious breath that deals 7d8 Void Damage damage (Basic DC 29 Reflex Saving Throw). A creature that fails its save is also Blinded until the end of its next turn (or for 1 minute on a critical failure) as a milky film coats its eyes.</p>\n<p>The gholdako can't use Blinding Breath again for 1d4 rounds.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Infectious Visions",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [
        "divine",
        "mental",
        "poison"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The first time each round the gholdako damages a creature with a claw Strike, the creature must attempt a DC 27 Will Saving Throw save, as its mind is assaulted by horrifying visions. On a failure, the creature is Confused until the end of its next turn. On a critical success, the creature is immune for 24 hours.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
